orce on high ground.","outlook":"The minimum temperature on Tuesday morning will be about 16 degrees in the urban areas, and a couple of degrees lower in the New Territories. It will still be rather cool in the New Territories on Wednesday morning. The temperature difference between day and night will be rather large. Temperatures rising progressively in the latter part of this week.","updateTime":"2026-11-08T22:45:00+08:00"},"dailyForecast":{"generalSituation":"A cold front will move across the coast of Guangdong at first tomorrow. Under the influence of the associated intense northeast monsoon, winds will strengthen from the north and temperatures will fall appreciably over the region. The weather will be generally fine and very dry over Guangdong midweek this week. It will be cool in the morning. The temperature difference between day and night will be rather large. The monsoon is expected to moderate in the latter part of this week, temperatures will rise over the region. Upper-air disturbances will bring showers to southern China towards the weekend. Besides, Tropical Cyclone Cempaka will move across the seas south of Japan in the next couple of days.","weatherForecast":[{"forecastDate":"20261109","week":"Monday","forecastWind":"North force 5, force 6 offshore, up to force 8 on high ground.","forecastWeather":"Cooler with one or two rain patches in the morning. Becoming fine and dry during the day. Temperatures will fall further at night.","forecastMaxtemp":{"value":26,"unit":"C"},"forecastMintemp":{"value":19,"unit":"C"},"forecastMaxrh":{"value":85,"unit":"percent"},"forecastMinrh":{"value":45,"unit":"percent"},"ForecastIcon":92,"PSR":"Low"},{"forecastDate":"20261110","week":"Tuesday","forecastWind":"North to northeast force 4 to 5, occasionally force 6 offshore at first, up to force 8 on high ground.","forecastWeather":"Cool in the morning. Fine. Very dry during the day.","forecastMaxtemp":{"value":23,"unit":"C"},"forecastMintemp":{"value":16,"unit":"C"},"for